The implementation iterates through the input list, updating the current subarray sum and its indices. If the current subarray sum becomes negative, it is reset to start from the current element. Indices are updated accordingly. The algorithm ensures correctness by comparing sums and indices at each step, favoring the earliest valid subarray in case of ties.

